DJ BRIDGE at GOODROOM 

@iambridgeet 
@goodroombk

@thecarrynation_nyc legendary monthly residency at the Good Room is coming to a close this Saturday. A decade of family, and growth, and so many magic moments. It’s the one and only party that has gotten me to leave my country boy life to partake in NYC nightlife, both behind the decks and on the dance floor. 
My Dad, @thefatherfigure introduced me to @willautomagic and @djnita after their 2015 Carnival F🔺G B🔺S H set. The energy of the night had me me drooling with puppy love. I held it down, dancing next to the decks, for 4 solid hours. I couldn’t get enough. And like so many in this beautiful circle, we very quickly became family. 
Words can’t speak enough about the love, kindness, and generosity from this duo. It radiates deep within our community, and shines bright on so many’s life’s. Love you so much Will and Nita. The best NYC nightlife Mom and Dad a Queer community could ask for 🖤. #chosenfamily #queerfamily #nycnightlife #housemusic

